# D.Ai Find reads the documents in the home folder into a local index, at the lowest priority (docs/BEYOND.md §11).
[Unit]
Description=D.Ai Find: the content index of my documents
Documentation=https://github.com/diamondrubinny/D.Ai/blob/main/docs/BEYOND.md

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Nice=19
IOSchedulingClass=idle
ExecStart=/usr/bin/dai-find index --quiet
